        "jsCode": "// Convex retries until it gets a 2xx, so an event can arrive twice (for example\n// when the email went out but the response was lost). Only events whose email\n// was actually sent are remembered (see \"Remember event\"), so a failed send is\n// retried instead of being dropped. Static data persists for production runs.\nconst event = $input.first().json.event;\nconst sent = $getWorkflowStaticData('global').sentEventIds ?? {};\nreturn [{ json: { event, duplicate: Boolean(sent[event.eventId]) } }];\n"
